1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,852
Ever notice there's never any money left at the end of the month?

2
00:00:04,202 --> 00:00:07,676
That is because spending quietly grows to fill whatever you earn.

3
00:00:08,026 --> 00:00:10,297
The fix is simple. Pay yourself first.

4
00:00:10,647 --> 00:00:15,284
The day your pay lands, move a set amount into savings, before you spend anything.

5
00:00:15,634 --> 00:00:19,718
Set it up as an automatic transfer, so you never have to decide again.

6
00:00:20,068 --> 00:00:26,173
Even ten percent is a great start. On two thousand a month, that's twenty four hundred dollars a year.

7
00:00:26,523 --> 00:00:30,461
Then spend what's left without the guilt. Future you already got paid.
